                            <comment id="13042371" author="fpj" created="Wed, 1 Jun 2011 19:15:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Uploading a preliminary patch that solves this problem, but does not include a test yet.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13044844" author="fpj" created="Mon, 6 Jun 2011 13:49:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Includes a test, which fails if we remove the fix in grabCleanPage. The test essentially stresses the ledger page cache mechanism by creating a large number of ledgers.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
